# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Docker build context filter — keep only what the multi-stage build needs.
# Everything listed here is excluded from `docker build` context.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Build outputs — they'll be regenerated inside the container
**/bin
**/obj
**/*.user
**/publish/
**/out/
**/artifacts/

# IDE / editor artifacts
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.suo
*.swp
*.swo

# Version control
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github/

# Local secrets — MUST NEVER end up in an image
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pfx
*.key
*.pem

# Tests (not needed for production image; CI runs them separately)
tests/

# Documentation (only README.md gets included when useful)
*.md
docs/

# Package manager caches
node_modules/
.nuget/
.dotnet/

# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Docker files themselves — no self-reference needed
Dockerfile*
compose.yml
docker-compose*.yml

# Misc project files not needed at runtime
Makefile
.editorconfig
